        },
        {
          "question": "bound-needs-no-t-restriction",
          "status": "answered",
          "node": "a97A02:B7",
          "quote": "Notice which\nhypotheses the chain consumed: measurability, the window bound, and\n\\( p \\ge 1 \\). The restriction \\( t \\in [0,1] \\) never entered, so the same\nestimate holds for every real \\( t \\).",
          "ink_words": 36,
          "graph_support": [
